The central character in the story is was born and grew up in 1950’s in a pioneering country.
A central theme of novels, mythology and hollywood influenced culture was USA wild west pioneer.
The pioneer is said to be ale to walk into wild untamed country. 
Live off the land. Build a home and family with sweat and bare hands. 
All with minimal detriment to the climate.

Our character grew up comfortably and at the dawn of the computer and internet age his conditioning kicks in. 

This is the promised land, his wild west to pioneer.

Like minds everywhere, BBS, computer clubs, clone hardware, public domain. 
Startups with free access and accounts every where.

Hardware that others out-grew and threw away. Open source. Linux, bsd, free pubnix servers, free database servers. 
And then the miracle free AI. 

The story is about the challenge and joy of living in the domain of “free” or low cost computing and 
intelligence as a responsible citizen trying to add to general community well being.

The book ends today as AI access starts to be fully commercialized. And how our pioneer can keep 
contributing to society within the public domain and free assets, free tier of database servers, hosting, etc


